# Bind the workspace's VNC display to this session. `service = "browser"` is
# the built-in chassis service (127.0.0.1:5900); the page names it, and the
# chassis resolves the name — the page can never name a host or a port. On
# success the chassis sends {"type":"attached"} and then the VNC bytes; a
# failure (the display is not up — call /setup first) merges as
# workspace.error, which 300/connect-error reports.
WHEN .msg.type == "connect"
  EXEC "workspace://tools/connect"
    WITH service = "browser",
         max_duration = "2h",
         into = "_connect"
